{%- doc -%}
  The one line that tells a shopper a code exists at all.

  It sits next to the discount field in both carts — the drawer's and the
  Horizon cart page's — because the popup that hands the code out never opens on
  /cart, and a field with nothing to type into it is a field she skips.

  The code is the live "משפחת LUXAMOM" discount in the admin: 10%, once per
  customer, handed out on signing up to the list. Change it in one place here if
  that discount is ever renamed.
{%- enddoc -%}

<p class="lxm-cart-code-hint">
  אין לך קוד? מצטרפות לרשימת התפוצה ומקבלות
  <b>10% הנחה על ההזמנה הראשונה</b> — הקוד <span class="lxm-cart-code-hint-code">LUXAMOM10</span>
</p>
